cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: Data Prism
abstract: "Data Prism is an open-source privacy layer for Java/Spring teams putting LLM agents or MCP clients in front of internal APIs holding customer data. It pseudonymises personal data per privacy scope, refuses anything unclassified, and can keep a hash-chained audit trail."
authors:
  - name: Andrew Bannister
repository-code: https://github.com/AindriuB/data-prism
license: Apache-2.0
